  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9655151367188,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Sensitivity of TBSTs among children and adolescents is shown in   The pooled  Fig. 3.1.1.4.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9921264648438,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity in four studies for this class of tests was 97.1% (95% CI: 81.9–99.6%). The number",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.969970703125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "of participants included in this analysis was small – only 34 participants in four studies; hence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.1241455078125,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "the studies were downgraded two levels for imprecision. Therefore, the evidence certainty",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.963623046875,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "was considered low. Only studies on Diaskintest were available for this analysis. Aggerbeck  (7)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999199867248535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        527.0196533203125,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "estimated the sensitivity of Cy-Tb in 12 children and adolescents with TB, of whom only two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        410.41949462890625,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "were bacteriologically confirmed and were not included in the figure.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.6308135986328,
        138.8640899658203,
        204.06680297851562
      ],
      "text": "Specificity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.3037109375,
        527.2164916992188,
        227.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "A total of 14 studies involving 3792 participants provided data for evaluating specificity of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.8037109375,
        526.6143798828125,
        242.94871520996094
      ],
      "text": "TBSTs (including difference in specificity compared with the reference test); three of the studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971512794494629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.3037109375,
        526.9918823242188,
        258.44873046875
      ],
      "text": "included 1104 children and adolescents and three included 587 BCG-vaccinated individuals.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.8037109375,
        526.7137451171875,
        273.94873046875
      ],
      "text": "Specificity was measured in healthy individuals with negative IGRA results. Difference in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.3037109375,
        526.6813354492188,
        289.44873046875
      ],
      "text": "specificity was used as an alternative specificity measure, and was calculated as the difference in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.955259323120117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.8037109375,
        524.3778686523438,
        304.94873046875
      ],
      "text": "the proportion of negative results between TBSTs and the TST or IGRAs in healthy populations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98634147644043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.5899353027344,
        474.4620666503906,
        333.67791748046875
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 3.1.1.5 Specificity in healthy individuals with negative IGRA results",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.2830200195312,
        526.9733276367188,
        533.4280395507812
      ],
      "text": "The specificity assessed in the five studies presented in   was high for all three tests  Fig. 3.1.1.5",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.7830200195312,
        527.1541137695312,
        548.9280395507812
      ],
      "text": "in the TBST class. For Diaskintest it was 99.1% (95% CI: 93.6–99.9%), as compared with QFT; for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972816467285156,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.2830200195312,
        526.9590454101562,
        564.4280395507812
      ],
      "text": "Cy-Tb it was 98.0% (95% CI: 92.6–99.5%), as compared with QFT; and for C-TST it was 95.5%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.7830200195312,
        526.9918823242188,
        579.9280395507812
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 92.6–97.3%), as compared with T-Spot. During the GDG meeting, participants noted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.2830200195312,
        526.9149169921875,
        595.4280395507812
      ],
      "text": "that – considering the totality of evidence (which included studies of very low quality) – the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.7830200195312,
        441.46002197265625,
        610.9280395507812
      ],
      "text": "overall certainty of the evidence on tests’ effects for specificity was very low.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.7869262695312,
        526.9632568359375,
        634.9319458007812
      ],
      "text": "Specificity in children and adolescents (2 studies, 176 patients), as determined in individuals",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.2869262695312,
        527.1979370117188,
        650.4319458007812
      ],
      "text": "with negative IGRA results, was high. For Diaskintest with a cut-off of at least 5 mm it was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.7869262695312,
        527.1405639648438,
        665.9319458007812
      ],
      "text": "99.1% (95% CI: 94.9–99.9%), as compared with QFT, and for Cy-Tb it was 91.4% (95% CI:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.2869262695312,
        526.96240234375,
        681.4319458007812
      ],
      "text": "82.2–96.1%), as compared with QFT. Specificity in BCG-vaccinated individuals (3 studies, 292",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.7869262695312,
        526.844970703125,
        696.9319458007812
      ],
      "text": "patients), as determined in healthy individuals with negative IGRA results, was also high, being",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984990119934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.2869262695312,
        526.9656982421875,
        712.4319458007812
      ],
      "text": "97–99% (depending on the test), with a pooled value of 99.0% (95% CI: 96.9–99.7%). More",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.7869262695312,
        259.62371826171875,
        727.9319458007812
      ],
      "text": "details can be found in  . Web Annex A",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "128 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
